WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.700
bilingual quiz funnel. Animated system walkthrough of the documented flow. Animated from the documented flow. Sample values only, no client data.

2
00:00:02.750 --> 00:00:04.650
A visitor answers twenty questions, in either language

3
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:07.350
Serverless functions hold the only key and store the lead

4
00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:09.550
Fixed rules score the answers into one of five profiles

5
00:00:09.600 --> 00:00:11.200
A model is consulted only when two profiles tie

6
00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.750
The report is built from the profile, Brevo confirms the opt-in

7
00:00:13.800 --> 00:00:16.150
Then the report reaches the visitor by email

8
00:00:16.300 --> 00:00:20.400
The profile is decided by rules, so every result can be explained

9
00:00:20.550 --> 00:00:23.100
bilingual quiz funnel. System walkthrough of the documented architecture. No product footage.

